# Optional: a keyed Sepolia RPC URL for the scripts in examples/ that read SEPOLIA_RPC_URL (the e2e rounds,
# send-timeout). Without it they use a public node. A URL that carries a provider's key is a secret. T-480, row N137.
# Add this file to an op run only when the item exists in the vault: op run stops on a reference it cannot resolve.
SEPOLIA_RPC_URL=op://crow/mac-sepolia-rpc/credential
